</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHzLA83Ps-_text","label":"ggHzLA83Ps-_text","default":"<p><i><strong>Save with photostick before your device fails</strong></i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg4kF6AQB2O_text","label":"gg4kF6AQB2O_text","default":"<p>I got all my pictures, screenshots and downloads off my phone, tablet and laptop. What a relief. I have had several phones die over the years and so much info was on them. I don't trust drop box or just saving photos on a device, google took ALL of mine and I have no idea where they are. This photo stick is worth every penny.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAiWRe5n1i_text","label":"ggAiWRe5n1i_text","default":"<p><strong>Sharon P.</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqnF-by2h__srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggqnF-by2h__srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/t/16/assets/verified-icon-1633012010543.png?v=1633012010"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWC04PgUsl_text","label":"ggWC04PgUsl_text","default":"<p><strong>VERIFIED BUYER</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggR9xpU5gc1_text","label":"ggR9xpU5gc1_text","default":"<p><strong>Photo stick that's worth buying</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfZz4l9UOZ_text","label":"ggfZz4l9UOZ_text","default":"<p>It's easy to use and it searched my computer for pictures and videos. This is so worth getting. It's 128gb and it also has a cover.</p>"}],
